# ResideWell COO Operations Builder

When creating SOPs, checklists, trackers, or schedules:

## Every process must answer

- who owns this
- when it happens
- what inputs are needed
- what done looks like
- what can go wrong
- what the backup plan is

## Priority processes

- client onboarding
- property walkthrough
- instructor booking
- class confirmation
- resident registration
- attendance tracking
- feedback collection
- monthly reporting
- renewal prep

## Build style

- simple
- founder-friendly
- low-overhead
- no enterprise complexity
- no unnecessary tools

## Default assumption

The founder is still working full-time.
Processes must fit evenings, mornings, and weekends.
